      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEXLEY (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 19.77 beating Velocity Smolder. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from six attempts. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. FLYING SEAL (7) ran good time (21.84) winning a Grade 3/4 three back at this track but missed the frame latest finishing fourth at this track. Expected to do much better this time. MAGIC SHAZAM (5) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Daysea's Max (21.89) in a Grade 4. Has the pace to be prominent. Comes through a solid form race last start. Can measure up. NINA SIYAN (2) was in the money last start and poses a threat again.",
